[
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0f17dd29003647e9c3e6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 3.46,
    "text": "Now, what's the size of it compared to the other place? Because now I remember that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5bc6fa8fb9be0ba1f452",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 3.46,
    "end_time": 11.1,
    "text": "The size of the classroom? Yeah. Maybe 2 thirds, that's big. What do you have fewer children, too?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_54b58b4e0b2d634cbb4e",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 11.1,
    "end_time": 11.66,
    "text": "Oh, that's good."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_372f71030fa928eacd7c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 11.66,
    "end_time": 13.46,
    "text": "About 20 or 22."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2a3b86a8d38745585415",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 13.46,
    "end_time": 14.5,
    "text": "Oh, that's good."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f42c16a8c8f08187b460",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 14.5,
    "end_time": 20.22,
    "text": "Smallest class in school. They range, I think, from my 20 to about 32."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1e65e771bc1421f7a552",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 20.22,
    "end_time": 21.34,
    "text": "And what grade is it again?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6aa4ab59bf34ba0b8e1c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 21.34,
    "end_time": 21.94,
    "text": "Third."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f853e0e4ffbcc517714f",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 21.94,
    "end_time": 22.98,
    "text": "OK."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3811f19f84ab87c9ca2b",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 22.98,
    "end_time": 28.740000000000002,
    "text": "They don't like to pass 30, but I think the seventh grade has 32. And they might not all show up either."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d1f272a4056c9b47fbfc",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 28.740000000000002,
    "end_time": 32.34,
    "text": "Now, you never can tell with people like that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3a31bb497fb02689e1e5",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 32.34,
    "end_time": 34.18,
    "text": "So, we should see."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_00637467938b12d00c12",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 34.18,
    "end_time": 36.260000000000005,
    "text": "Well, I'm glad you have a smaller number now."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_17d711573efd1e9f8215",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 36.260000000000005,
    "end_time": 37.7,
    "text": "Oh, and it's all one grade."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3e01e9ec0f1bd7796856",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 37.7,
    "end_time": 42.46,
    "text": "And it's all one grade. You almost won't know what to do with yourself."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_c84d2b2970aa78140ea3",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 42.46,
    "end_time": 44.900000000000006,
    "text": "I think I'll find many a thing to do, so now."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_8bc64e086cfa95b7ffc5",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 44.900000000000006,
    "end_time": 48.3,
    "text": "Oh, gosh. So have you seen any other teacher?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9c2a8968451e4f50533c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 48.3,
    "end_time": 59.7,
    "text": "Oh, yes. See, when the principal was away, two of the men, the second grade teacher, John McCall, was a lovely gentleman, and the computer teacher, Mr. Devereaux, covered the office for the principal."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f67be3e4fc404a14d855",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 59.7,
    "end_time": 60.74,
    "text": "I see."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_8b9876f000992ca23e93",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 60.74,
    "end_time": 68.18,
    "text": "So John McCall was doing it that last week. And Mr. Devereaux was doing it the week before that. So they were very helpful."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6dd02fc6653880019110",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 68.18,
    "end_time": 71.58,
    "text": "Now, will your class have much opportunity to use the computer?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2ead2cfce848d2b82f53",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 71.58,
    "end_time": 76.42,
    "text": "Oh, yes. Once a week, they go up for 45 minutes. I have three computers in my classroom."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_fe926168337192bb52d0",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 76.42,
    "end_time": 76.94,
    "text": "Do you?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_170b243d73ef26f764b6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 76.94,
    "end_time": 79.7,
    "text": "Yes. Every classroom has two or three."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3033fa368db448a328b8",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 79.7,
    "end_time": 80.34,
    "text": "That's good."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5376ea8131b1e12c79f8",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 80.34,
    "end_time": 89.06,
    "text": "Yeah, it is great. They're real old, and the ones in the room, they're like the old Commodores, I think. But they're IBM-compatible."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6f961fe3056201b0ac02",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 89.06,
    "end_time": 92.18,
    "text": "That's good. And so what programs and what we use?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_58f1d344a146103783d6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 92.18,
    "end_time": 106.66,
    "text": "Well, I think what he's done, see, Mr. Devereaux makes these disks to go with your work. So if you want something in addition of facts up to nine, he'll have a disk that you can use to reinforce those disks."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_cac8ab26c37502e8edd3",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 106.66,
    "end_time": 107.46000000000001,
    "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_afa674d8ed36f0005121",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 107.46000000000001,
    "end_time": 108.34,
    "text": "Yes, he's done that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_91ac8e1abc7ee559506d",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 108.34,
    "end_time": 108.94,
    "text": "That's great."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_aa35e1d2f8d9ece5e2c3",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 108.94,
    "end_time": 111.46000000000001,
    "text": "He's been there 25 years, they say."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a0fd44255e5bf9057341",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 111.46000000000001,
    "end_time": 112.30000000000001,
    "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_19c0ec8e389a3e6b46f6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 112.30000000000001,
    "end_time": 116.74,
    "text": "Yeah, so he has spent many, many hours just making disks for the teachers."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_cffc57493351cdb658ce",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 116.74,
    "end_time": 118.38,
    "text": "That's fantastic."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d01033ef5fc8bab91902",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 118.38,
    "end_time": 123.38,
    "text": "And we have an art teacher, a music teacher, and a gym teacher."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9d3a1667cdd9297997fd",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 123.38,
    "end_time": 123.98,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_8c933e880890ff77cc93",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 123.98,
    "end_time": 127.94,
    "text": "And a full-time librarian, plus an assistant librarian, who's a sister."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3ef70ba6ca078655b039",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 127.94,
    "end_time": 128.94,
    "text": "My goodness."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5b0253cbd20d34f06463",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 128.94,
    "end_time": 142.3,
    "text": "A sister. So you do get three 40-minute periods, well, three half-hour periods, by the time you're done, you're just going to bring them back a week. But I think you also have to stay with the children all during lunch and recess."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2a9c597b8e1d1442e637",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 142.3,
    "end_time": 143.02,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_34966ed694fe980a5ee6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 143.06,
    "end_time": 144.82000000000002,
    "text": "So that's a great one."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_cd115fdf550ae11c51d9",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 144.82000000000002,
    "end_time": 146.06,
    "text": "So when do you get your lunch?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_61918bf3939fcefcd6b0",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 146.06,
    "end_time": 147.86,
    "text": "You want to eat with them? With them, as far as I know."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5c7cad267c2d9f543cba",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 147.86,
    "end_time": 148.86,
    "text": "Would they eat in the room? Is that it?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_924f905fa1eb73993939",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 148.86,
    "end_time": 150.46,
    "text": "In the classroom, yes, as far as I know."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_eb8578dfc3de04f02c24",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 150.46,
    "end_time": 151.42000000000002,
    "text": "Oh, gee."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f72bf89452cc65006181",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 151.42000000000002,
    "end_time": 152.18,
    "text": "I hate that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_eeed99c1d42aabe6c9b6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 152.18,
    "end_time": 154.82000000000002,
    "text": "I hate to have food in the room. Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6e983501fd3cce44d4e2",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 154.82000000000002,
    "end_time": 161.46,
    "text": "It makes animals, but, however. Well, speaking of animals, if we headed into macular conception last year,"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d6a423b403c317167405",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 161.46,
    "end_time": 162.62,
    "text": "I'm sorry about that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1efe203c8cf7d1c3ffd6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 162.62,
    "end_time": 164.02,
    "text": "Get back again."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_faa4fc1e33861bdf5053",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 164.02,
    "end_time": 165.02,
    "text": "Out of macular conception."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_eaf1b316e50395d509d7",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 165.02,
    "end_time": 169.78,
    "text": "Out of macular conception. Carol Ann Setcher was eaten alive every day."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9d33d629ab001a609b13",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 169.78,
    "end_time": 170.46,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f300eec95fffaf16fbc1",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 170.46,
    "end_time": 173.38,
    "text": "And Valerie was over there, helping her with something on the computer."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6c320c74132147ef102e",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 173.38,
    "end_time": 174.02,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_46533cae512e5f6830b7",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 174.02,
    "end_time": 183.7,
    "text": "When Valerie came home, she had welts all over her whole legs. I said, where were you today? She's in macular conception. I said, they're free."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_af7525e0cba601ff5f49",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 183.7,
    "end_time": 184.18,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a2f74a4f4e456bd7066c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 184.18,
    "end_time": 187.78,
    "text": "No, she said, no. Yes, they are Valerie."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3b7215f100ce8f5c1d9a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 187.78,
    "end_time": 188.98000000000002,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_584b8571bdebbeae632c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 188.98000000000002,
    "end_time": 192.34,
    "text": "So Carol Ann had to get the exterminator to put the bombs in the rooms again."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a7e770d5af8cbea60453",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 192.34,
    "end_time": 192.86,
    "text": "Oh, my."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_c73ce68d03c8f328abfd",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 192.86,
    "end_time": 196.74,
    "text": "They closed everything up on Friday. And they bombed up the whole place too."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2dd45038248157e1813d",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 196.74,
    "end_time": 198.02,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_085d801bf3566f9a8bc3",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 198.02,
    "end_time": 201.26,
    "text": "But how did they come back? I guess all the eggs stay in the rug. Is that it?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1bcb021d453686cf3da0",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 201.29999999999998,
    "end_time": 206.98,
    "text": "Well, I don't know. I guess they do. But that's a long time incubating. I mean, you didn't have them through the entire year."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_17e34056902825940b9c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 206.98,
    "end_time": 211.98,
    "text": "No, they didn't have it again. Unless they come in the windows in the summer. That could be it."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d2446a061f4976b8960a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 211.98,
    "end_time": 213.17999999999998,
    "text": "Yeah, maybe there's some way."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_eb34e24ab41ac73dbbbb",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 213.17999999999998,
    "end_time": 215.5,
    "text": "And they infest the rugs."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_b81db34a31a73df8a98a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 215.5,
    "end_time": 217.89999999999998,
    "text": "Because there are no animals around there, right?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_3c1eba2706081b2c2c45",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 217.89999999999998,
    "end_time": 222.57999999999998,
    "text": "Animals? No. No, no dogs or cats or raccoon rats or anything like that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a24603d7e199a0f4bba4",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 222.57999999999998,
    "end_time": 224.22,
    "text": "Well, they could be rats."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e1ed5e61b73bbe00249c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 224.22,
    "end_time": 227.62,
    "text": "I've never seen any. Mice, I'm sure there are."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_bb7bf0c72dd8a974ce5b",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 227.62,
    "end_time": 235.38,
    "text": "But yeah. Well, thank God you discovered them now before school started. Could you imagine?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_06a5cd9268d1d4634ee5",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 235.38,
    "end_time": 254.46,
    "text": "Well, they were in the building when we started school last year. The Royal Kindergarteners were all bitten when they sat down on the floor. Because they were kind of a band-aid on their legs. And one mother wrote a note, dear Mrs. Henry, my child is bitten by something on her legs. He must have fleas in the school."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a8439fc1abaf488e105b",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 254.46,
    "end_time": 256.46,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_7cf320768f426e3c28e6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 256.46,
    "end_time": 259.1,
    "text": "But they're the most awful bites that I've ever had."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f4fdbcdec2321f394c88",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 259.1,
    "end_time": 263.06,
    "text": "Yes, I had a patient's home one. Oh, they are awful."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a023454339270e8f45d6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 263.06,
    "end_time": 264.90000000000003,
    "text": "And the mugs, they took you."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_8285e86cce34f0d52383",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 264.90000000000003,
    "end_time": 270.5,
    "text": "Yes. I thought I really can commiserate with animals now. Little dogs when I see them scratching."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f2ec948cd11eb7de1038",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 270.5,
    "end_time": 275.02000000000004,
    "text": "Oh, it's a terrible thing. And they bleed and form this terrible scab."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_789366fa175b526466d8",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 275.02000000000004,
    "end_time": 277.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9bd3110baa6e70e0091b",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 277.5,
    "end_time": 279.26000000000005,
    "text": "Well, tell me about your life now."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_327b1b6fb0a5392ca57a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 279.26000000000005,
    "end_time": 290.1,
    "text": "Oh, I had a wonderful time down in Baltimore. Really good symposium. I love the workshop. And then in the evening, my mom and I linked up together. And we did something different each night."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ea0b7877cfb84ed1b472",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 290.1,
    "end_time": 290.74,
    "text": "Oh, nice."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0494e4d9a9cf35ad24df",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 290.74,
    "end_time": 298.66,
    "text": "Yeah. The first night we went over to the Inner Harbor. And then the second night, they had scheduled a cruise on the Spirit of Baltimore."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_00608eebcf4910f760e4",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 298.66,
    "end_time": 299.86,
    "text": "Oh, yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_29d859924e2d47506401",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 299.86,
    "end_time": 311.98,
    "text": "And fortunately, that hurricane didn't affect us. It was supposed to hit that night and have very choppy borders and everything. But it didn't. It was a beautiful evening. And that was about a three-hour cruise."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_c659144a6bf48c9dd2ef",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 311.98,
    "end_time": 312.62,
    "text": "Oh, nice."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0df2140e8e40d986c67a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 312.62,
    "end_time": 323.46000000000004,
    "text": "Yes. We were on the ship over three hours, actually moving about three, I guess. And then the third night, we went over to Little Italy and had a very nice Italian dinner. Yeah. It was fun."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5a7696356df73f26845e",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 323.46000000000004,
    "end_time": 324.06000000000006,
    "text": "Oh, good."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2a42107dad45f306a21d",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 324.06000000000006,
    "end_time": 328.74,
    "text": "Really was. And the Little Italy looks very much like South Philadelphia,"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_05ad25e0feb5126fb7d6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 328.74,
    "end_time": 329.86,
    "text": "actually."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_01dbaa1bfd1d2feb1f68",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 329.86,
    "end_time": 347.14000000000004,
    "text": "And the restaurants are in the row houses. The row houses are just kind of broken through on the inside, you know? And, yeah. So it was fun. Part of that family was nice. Yeah. My mom got a lot of rest while I was at the workshop full day. She was resting, enjoying herself."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_67542192814fe0bc9616",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 347.14,
    "end_time": 348.41999999999996,
    "text": "That's nice she could go with you."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_dff94807cc59ff707901",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 348.41999999999996,
    "end_time": 351.14,
    "text": "Yeah, I'm glad she could. It just happened to work out because she"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_28185077f2f5f63e8eac",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 351.14,
    "end_time": 356.41999999999996,
    "text": "had three days left of vacation and it was three days. And then you had a good time at the beach. I know."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2e1c4dc853ff11ac54f1",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 356.41999999999996,
    "end_time": 368.34,
    "text": "Oh, yeah. That was nice and relaxing. That was great, too. It really was. The thing with this, the hotel happened to be about a block away from Candon Yards, which is the stadium."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5c5efdc594e29430cee7",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 368.34,
    "end_time": 369.3,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e7f73096344d05ed5b92",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 369.3,
    "end_time": 398.42,
    "text": "Well, we arrived. Just as the traffic was going in for the game. Oh, no. I didn't know there was a game. I didn't even know where I was going. I was just following the direction. Well, the traffic, I was beside myself. I said, oh my goodness. And here, when we, as we approached the stadium, we saw that's where people were headed. And we thought, oh, there must be a game. And sure enough, there was. So for the first three days, the Orioles had a home game. So the traffic was unbelievable. But I didn't drive."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6fe3831c68c18e5a0895",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 398.42,
    "end_time": 414.42,
    "text": "I got there, but we were just walking around it. They're such avid fans. It's unbelievable. I mean, everything was the Orioles. And of course, I knew nothing about the Orioles other than they're a team. And it seems one of their players is about to break Lou Gehrig's record or something. Oh, yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_50893ae79f3bfc5f5082",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 414.42,
    "end_time": 415.74,
    "text": "It's on the TV. Oh, listen to you."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_dfd481884c566ead43ea",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 415.74,
    "end_time": 428.54,
    "text": "You know all this stuff. See, I didn't know. I'm seeing it on the TV. It's like one of the stars is talking about this player whom I never heard of and how proud they are of him. And everybody says, oh, this whole town's going to go crazy when it breaks that record."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d0d439b4dfe5f5a24e7e",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 428.54,
    "end_time": 429.62,
    "text": "All this."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_4b740501e6bf1e06c49a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 429.62,
    "end_time": 434.06,
    "text": "Oh, well, good old Phillies. We're not quite that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6602af459031a16b156c",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 434.26,
    "end_time": 436.14,
    "text": "They find out to the bottom again. Haven't they?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_7b7205433e2d7ecb48eb",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 436.14,
    "end_time": 437.7,
    "text": "No, they won today."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_0cb58a477a7a61b7f198",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 437.7,
    "end_time": 438.14,
    "text": "Or did they?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2b96d44adb7db946aa4b",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 438.14,
    "end_time": 449.46,
    "text": "Yes, Pat was listening to the game. They won today in the 10-10ing. And they won another game this week. So that's good. I'm going to go get back up there. They're coming up a little bit. But they really get into these slumps."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_e0779a08dfd4b121b111",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 449.46,
    "end_time": 451.3,
    "text": "Yes, unbelievable."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_d08afbfd94046961db07",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 451.3,
    "end_time": 467.5,
    "text": "Once they, you almost hate to see them lose the game because it's as though here goes about 12 or 13. They're going to lose. It's like they don't just lose one or two. And then when it's just, they get into a real slump. Well, but anyway. And so it's not just Pat and I home."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_1d9484d363e224f55188",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 467.5,
    "end_time": 468.78,
    "text": "And that's all Mary's like."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_617727494d347bbe5ad3",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 468.78,
    "end_time": 472.62,
    "text": "She's on retreat. She gets back Tuesday afternoon."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_bc6843d14556fb491dbf",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 472.62,
    "end_time": 476.38,
    "text": "And, uh, how did you see them today?"
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f106251a7c7baaf89547",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 476.38,
    "end_time": 495.1,
    "text": "I did, yeah. Pat and I went over. And we went over this morning about 11. Well, she looked well. And she's on complete bed rest because she has the phlebitis, definitely. And they had to give her the heparin. And of course, that affects her platelets. And, you know, she said he was going to give her the chemo this Thursday."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_4059264550e5ab7f02fa",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 495.1,
    "end_time": 496.54,
    "text": "Oh, wow."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_a27a82e3ea00b263972f",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 496.54,
    "end_time": 506.18,
    "text": "So I don't know. She said I'm just disgusted. And, you know, I could appreciate this. But I'm thinking, why doesn't he hold off another week? I mean, you know, each one is counteracting the other."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2c62882b701dfb80e125",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 506.18,
    "end_time": 507.58,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_2b8d885985a2cf4279f1",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 507.58,
    "end_time": 524.14,
    "text": "It's a hard, I mean, I know it's an easy decision for him to make Norfolk a reader. But I'm thinking, oh my gosh, you know. But she seemed in good spirits and had a couple books there at the TV when we got there. And she said, I'm really dozing through this. You know, it was one of the new shows."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_9c2bb234a998061c7f3a",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 524.14,
    "end_time": 525.0200000000001,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_aeb6b52635e5c887c6e9",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 525.0200000000001,
    "end_time": 528.58,
    "text": "And then Marie Catherine, I saw yesterday."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f51eeab23d1f96c2e985",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 528.58,
    "end_time": 529.94,
    "text": "And she's been living new shows."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_f2649a5d821cf9566291",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 529.94,
    "end_time": 532.7,
    "text": "Yes, she told me that. She told me that."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_085d5e24b9a5c20cb229",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 532.7,
    "end_time": 539.74,
    "text": "So the day that she, that I was leaving, was the day that she moved in there, you know? Oh, really? That morning. Yes."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6b0b95e76a996a256dcf",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 539.74,
    "end_time": 540.24,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_339de214c74e3181267f",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 540.24,
    "end_time": 543.5400000000001,
    "text": "That morning. Thank God. I mean, I had cleaned the room before."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_486337193c81939ab7a6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 543.5400000000001,
    "end_time": 545.5400000000001,
    "text": "The day before. Oh, my goodness."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_78f7d14c0be9861fe4d0",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 545.5400000000001,
    "end_time": 546.0200000000001,
    "text": "Because that's the day."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_5ff74852c091f453d361",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 546.0200000000001,
    "end_time": 549.26,
    "text": "You mean the day that Marcia picked you up that day? Yes, that's right."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_ab4733d613ef21cb1da6",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 549.26,
    "end_time": 551.54,
    "text": "I knew Marcia would be there. Like after lunch or something."
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "chunk_6b239a3ad6288af98fd7",
    "conversation_id": "call_001",
    "source_file": "call_001.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 551.54,
    "end_time": 552.14,
